    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about Wana products like their fast-acting THC gummies or their Stay Asleep high-CBD gummies and more.</strong> <em>Great flavors to choose from Pina Colada, Strawberry Margarita, Limoncello and Blueberry Acai … and more!</em></p><p><strong>The Wana Way</strong></p><p>Wana’s mission is to enhance people’s lives by unlocking the full potential of the cannabis plant. That means using only the highest quality ingredients, investing in cutting-edge innovation, and giving back to all the communities we serve.</p><p><strong>How do you Wana feel?</strong></p><p>Wana products come in an ever-growing variety of doses, onset times, class-specific terpene blends, and cannabinoid ratios… so you can customize your ideal cannabis experience.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/wana/\"><strong>Click here to shop Wana products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
